  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 321 – 371 ÷ 22 + 216 × 6 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '−' are interchanged and '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n321 – 371 ÷ 22 + 216 × 6 = ? ⇒ 321 + 371 × 22 – 216 ÷ 6 = ?\n\n⇒ 321 + 371 × 22 – __**216 **____**÷**____** 6**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 321 + __**371 **____**×**____** 22**__ – 36 = ?\n\n⇒ __**321 + 8162**__ – 36 = ?\n\n⇒ __8483____** – 3**____**6**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **8447** **= ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
